# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Removing Glarb withdraws its permission to cast the library top.
# Forcing: Baloth begins on top and Unsummon can return Glarb to hand.
# AI behavior: An empty hand and battlefield provide no response decisions.
# Failure modes: A remaining library cast action after Glarb leaves disproves withdrawal.
# Card roles: Glarb grants permission; Baloth is eligible; Unsummon removes the source.
